{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Station Files</strong> is a hardcore turn\u2011based roguelike puzzle about surviving on a doomed space station, experienced entirely through the <strong>Evacom\u2122</strong> \u2014<strong> </strong>portable emergency<strong>\u00a0</strong>\u200bterminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/bc8a753e7590bcf92fc7765e77014cf3.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=960 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/bc8a753e7590bcf92fc7765e77014cf3.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/bc8a753e7590bcf92fc7765e77014cf3.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/e55c0b3573395bca2bf0a3c0f3abff35.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=500 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/e55c0b3573395bca2bf0a3c0f3abff35.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/e55c0b3573395bca2bf0a3c0f3abff35.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead under pressure: use station systems, avoid deadly hazards, and make hard decisions to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/9f796501407deac5340a44d6fe170cb7.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/9f796501407deac5340a44d6fe170cb7.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/9f796501407deac5340a44d6fe170cb7.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/1df403796abe4f566770f4f262d2554a.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=500 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/1df403796abe4f566770f4f262d2554a.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/1df403796abe4f566770f4f262d2554a.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hostile entity that kills everyone and brutally punishes mistakes, pushing the stakes to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It evolves with the disaster, growing more dangerous as station conditions worsen and hazards spread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/3df1f87f44a012dc30cfdce3ad32f131.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=1170 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/3df1f87f44a012dc30cfdce3ad32f131.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/3df1f87f44a012dc30cfdce3ad32f131.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/20b1428342d981cc1e2f274da61e2f4e.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=500 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/20b1428342d981cc1e2f274da61e2f4e.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/20b1428342d981cc1e2f274da61e2f4e.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station is packed with connected events that change over time and with your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters play their part in the same tragedy from different points of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/426e1f4f07318f89ef7947327c5101e3.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=1170 height=880 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/426e1f4f07318f89ef7947327c5101e3.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/426e1f4f07318f89ef7947327c5101e3.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/75cba626dddf48bc158ee586cfcf9b58.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=500 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/75cba626dddf48bc158ee586cfcf9b58.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/75cba626dddf48bc158ee586cfcf9b58.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your evacuation route through a collapsing station: decide where to spend precious time and resources, when to intervene, and what to avoid at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/6790e5b55d97476dffa60927e4b2ecb3.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/6790e5b55d97476dffa60927e4b2ecb3.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/6790e5b55d97476dffa60927e4b2ecb3.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/62116b82c4d5dbf22fc8ccde89f37bc0.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=500 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/62116b82c4d5dbf22fc8ccde89f37bc0.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/62116b82c4d5dbf22fc8ccde89f37bc0.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large-scale tragedy told through fragmented records and files, pieced together by you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is spelled out. Connect the dots and uncover what happened and why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/3661349594a88ef4f0d8f64944d236e8.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=1170 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/3661349594a88ef4f0d8f64944d236e8.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/3661349594a88ef4f0d8f64944d236e8.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687410?t=1773743323","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/1adc6c58b6ae584df87683f4c23930e140747ae8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773743323","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/6a513616c99146056b16234d8f33837843972e2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773743323","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/6a513616c99146056b16234d8f33837843972e2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773743323","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains realistic depictions of blood, though they are infrequent and not the primary focus.\r\nPlayers may encounter scenes involving the implied death of characters, often represented through schematic visuals and atmospheric audio.\r\nThe narrative explores themes of isolation, survival, and catastrophic failure in a sci-fi horror setting.\r\nWhile there is no graphic violence or gore, the tone is tense and may not be appropriate for all players."},"demos":[{"appid":3691870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Station Files</strong> is a hardcore turn\u2011based roguelike puzzle about surviving on a doomed space station, experienced entirely through the <strong>Evacom\u2122</strong> \u2014<strong> </strong>portable emergency<strong>\u00a0</strong>\u200bterminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/bc8a753e7590bcf92fc7765e77014cf3.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=960 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/bc8a753e7590bcf92fc7765e77014cf3.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/bc8a753e7590bcf92fc7765e77014cf3.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/e55c0b3573395bca2bf0a3c0f3abff35.poster.avif?t=1773743323\" width=500 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/e55c0b3573395bca2bf0a3c0f3abff35.webm?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/e55c0b3573395bca2bf0a3c0f3abff35.mp4?t=1773743323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead under pressure: use station systems, avoid deadly hazards, and make hard decisions to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass